{"job_id":"F-56f82c3a1557bfc00417","family_id":"F-56f82c3a1557bfc00417","title":"인지 첩부·첨부 및 공탁 제공에 관한 특례법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":24,"target_id":"1a0769945c92f5f4a61477cf75791bdee6a862d0e610b83a391ffe99c3301cc7","source_hash":"c084104b90d49f267219276014be4deccd05b3f7e384ace471f5dc296d05b1d4","text":"关于印花税票的粘贴、附设及缴纳保证金的特别法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":138,"target_id":"1ad68e6955f69b275b09a4a1225564407fd941a60e59f96ed375477b64b21cc9","source_hash":"0ea53b29a977764d83b1e9d1164cd8207ae12da01e24286b05cd5fc0166e6336","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是为国家作为一方当事人的诉讼和行政诉讼中，就印花税票的粘贴、缴纳和保证金的提供制定特别规定，而不与《民事诉讼法》和《民事诉讼印花税法》等其他法律法规相冲突。<2012年12月18日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":138,"end":219,"target_id":"2ea4c5649037509ee23fabd3f17ad341ad6fb1192dcf568d974c626fb640f9e8","source_hash":"93e4f54628b349924a55f980f2e53d4dc8e19b26031ab3e63cf7ca69c3aed08b","text":"第二条（不粘贴印花税）国家不得按照《民事诉讼等印花税法》的规定，在国家作为一方当事人的诉讼和行政诉讼程序中粘贴印花税。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":219,"end":287,"target_id":"9c2b91531f9895cfb40bafc9eb4143f664368b9839ecb2709068008842dd772f","source_hash":"e2ebc5bbcd96c3885dea8fdffa9a8c686677a967058e0d3c352688dfdf72985c","text":"第三条（不缴纳保证金）国家在以国家为当事人的诉讼和行政诉讼中，不依据《民事诉讼法》缴纳保证金。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":287,"end":401,"target_id":"0a26f21f60230f5c8592e16767793526c933d706e8e8586c90b2d9d934fff569","source_hash":"5bf45466dbcc0fbb78a27aa51eae4ceeefcc8dfaa8147379628feba2b6e978a6","text":"补充条款 <第832条，1961年12月13日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n本法适用于生效时法院正在审理的案件。但是，本法不影响已贴的印花税票或已缴纳的保证金。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":401,"end":486,"target_id":"154db900a2663f48e11d96e321b2a9d9082c5cc607648b6e718ad326ac20f23d","source_hash":"30bd045b780ee749c8bd4e76ed0057c436e68002ac5c7c7647a54f11069d98d9","text":"增补（关于根据政府部门名称等变更修订建筑法等的法案）<1997年12月13日第5454号法案>\n\n本法自1998年1月1日起生效。（但书略）\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":486,"end":530,"target_id":"dfcf6cd73cdd533386a31f867ce36f57464b35083e2a4477006e9add58113c07","source_hash":"fe2dce002e95003c568d93a1dee08f69163ea801ab03880bff008b86f1ed26ae","text":"补充规定 <第9807号，2009年10月21日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":530,"end":568,"target_id":"9aa05a45a80a023cdf4bdd3110719a70d1f573b85bfcf45b7631967524b4a2fb","source_hash":"6d5e66c65443414fe55a53438d60147fa08c18a7523112d76b64de66c071dcd1","text":"补充条款（印花税法）<第11551号法案，2012年12月18日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":568,"end":606,"target_id":"c4680b4c27362fc3a3fdf579ec171e56dc8d5647888457416a51b2fa7581a39e","source_hash":"5b7b7ce00ce4ba4c696d6b6cc0d3cd9522eb78f4c0e501bed0ee7129bdb3666a","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起一年后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":606,"end":742,"target_id":"df9ce34364ced9c3d3b904ee87ea374432e059d8458e38b3dc82416538a0763b","source_hash":"1a7910a1b62ac08f72c48ae3e1dc97f669a1fae574afa56eadffdfdce4437a7c","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至③ 已省略\n\n  ④ 《关于贴印花税票和提供押金的特殊情况法》部分修改如下。 \n\n  标题“关于征收印花税和提供保证金的特别法”应改为“关于征收和扣押印花税以及提供保证金的特别法”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001214-130810-ko","scope":"BODY","start":742,"end":817,"target_id":"cddfad3dde3c5ed515154ff37eba7a898c0138528f95ae5fe02075878a245272","source_hash":"5676cc096ddd9fc9df17eb89d18c2426f903e1177e3452dee511409933ef3f3d","text":"  第 1 条中的“附件”应改为“附件/附件”。\n\n  第 2 条标题中的“不依附”应改为“不依附且不紧扣”。"}]}